.TH tkcsv n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkcsv \- CSV table viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkcsv
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkcsv::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on the tclutils engine. See docs/tkcsv.md for the full API.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget
